      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "知っているか？　帝都の南東「ヴァレリ峡谷」に、\n凶暴な狼の群れが住み着いていて、\n周辺では「八つ牙」と呼ばれ、恐れられている。\n腕に自信があるなら、退治に行ってみないか？",
        "official_en": "You must have heard, haven't you? There's a pack of\nwolves in the Valeri Gorge, southeast of the capital.\nThe people are scared and have even started calling\nthem the \"Eight Fangs.\" If you're strong, prove it.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
