      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "あの獣たちを退治してくれるとは！\nもっと早く依頼をすれば良かったよ。\n最近帝都周辺も物騒なんだが\nあんたらがいれば安心だな。",
        "official_en": "I can't believe you were able to exterminate those\nbeasts! I just wish I'd asked you sooner. The area\naround the capital has been a bit dangerous lately,\nbut with you here, we'll be fine.",
        "real_en": null
      },
